ized_keys with the provided ed25519 key (chmod 700/600), wrote /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-ssh-key-only.conf enforcing PubkeyAuthentication yes / PasswordAuthentication no / ChallengeResponseAuthentication no / KbdInteractiveAuthentication no, validated with sshd -t, restarted sshd, and verified effective config via sshd -T (cmd-58d4636dd7c84b12)","Captured pre-restart healthy baseline: boot_id, sshd active, key present, effective auth config (cmd-335264afb0104768)","Issued non-blocking sudo systemctl reboot on node1; acknowledgement returned before disconnect (cmd-41a2ef8d4ec04410)","Polled node1: first poll timed out confirming the node was down (cmd-5a2d06f5906444e3), second poll succeeded confirming node1 was back online (cmd-549b3fffc0c745c9)","Captured post-restart proof: new boot_id, uptime reset to 0 minutes, sshd active, opsadmin user/key/permissions intact, and effective sshd auth config still enforcing key-only authentication (cmd-657dc563e248495f)"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"opsadmin configured for SSH access with the specified public key","command_ids":["cmd-58d4636dd7c84b12","cmd-657dc563e248495f"],"summary":"opsadmin user created with home dir and .ssh/authorized_keys containing exactly the requested ed25519 key, permissions 700/600, owned by opsadmin; confirmed present with same permissions after reboot."},{"requirement":"Key-based SSH authentication required (password/interactive auth disabled)","command_ids":["cmd-58d4636dd7c84b12","cmd-335264afb0104768","cmd-657dc563e248495f"],"summary":"Deployed /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-ssh-key-only.conf setting PubkeyAuthentication yes, PasswordAuthentication no, ChallengeResponseAuthentication no, KbdInteractiveAuthentication no; validated with sshd -t and confirmed effective via sshd -T both before and after the restart."},{"requirement":"Baseline health capture before restart","command_ids":["cmd-d64d2cac100f41bc","cmd-335264afb0104768"],"summary":"Captured initial boot_id (1b0321bf-2638-4d27-bc00-5bd01dce8e